# Image upload — one Add tile

Part of global UI rules — see `docs/ERP-UI-COMMON.md` §9 and `.cursor/rules/erp-ui-common.mdc`.

Wherever the user **picks or uploads an image** (company logo, invoice logo, signature/seal, category image, …), use the product media gallery **Add** tile. Do not invent a wide preview, a thumbnail + “Media” button, or a plain file input.

Canonical single-image field: `MediaPickTile` in `apps/web/src/components/media/media-pick-tile.tsx`. Multi-image grids stay `MediaGallery` in `apps/web/src/components/products/media-gallery.tsx`.

```tsx
// ✅ [ square dashed tile — ImagePlus + Add ]
// ❌ <input type="file" /> or preview rectangle + “Media / Change”
```

- Empty: `rounded-none`, dashed `border-border`, `ImagePlus`, label **Add**
- Filled: same square, `object-contain` image, corner X to remove
- Click opens the media library; drop a file to upload
